# Parity tests

Any client helper that mirrors backend domain math needs a unit (or parity) test **in the same commit**:

| Helper area | Examples |
|-------------|----------|
| Game plans | selected-game normalization, ordered Eliminator stages |
| Projections | `eliminatorProjection`, Final alive counts |
| Funds / payouts | `highGameFundBalance`, shared payout helpers |
| Menu filtering | `reportMenuDefs` by type |

## Drift

If backend examples/fixtures change, update the FE test vectors in the same delivery window. Silent drift shows up as wrong director printouts and standings UI.
